[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4038904685","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117298#issuecomment-4038904685","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117298","id":4038904685,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wvMtt","user":{"login":"angsongyee","id":29880635,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODgwNjM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29880635?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angsongyee","html_url":"https://github.com/angsongyee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angsongyee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angsongyee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angsongyee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angsongyee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angsongyee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angsongyee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angsongyee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angsongyee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angsongyee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-11T12:32:22Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T14:04:16Z","body":"I tried to look into this, and it seems that while `text_editor/help/help_font_size` changes the font size on the editor help page (`EditorHelp`), `interface/editor/main_font_size` is used for the font size in tooltip texts (`EditorHelpBit`) instead. I couldn't find exactly where the font sizes are set, I'm guessing it might be using a default somewhere?\n\n`text_editor/help/help_source_font_size` does work on formatted code on both `EditorHelp` and `EditorHelpBit`, so I agree that `text_editor/help/help_font_size` should follow the same behaviour.\n\nOn second thought, might be a good idea to have a separate font size setting for tooltips and not share them with the editor help page.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4038904685/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]